    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_11",
      "hash64": "CE94247B27A3E137",
      "text": "BP is a kind of school currency you can use in the\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]cafeteria[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] or at the [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]school store[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].\\c\\nYou might be able to use it for [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]club activities [VAR 0xFF00(0000)]in\\nthe future too...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
