        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_system_01",
      "hash64": "77EA9E2EF59AFD90",
      "text": "You aren’t quite ready to progress further in the\\nadventure awaiting you at Blueberry Academy!\\c\\nTo do so, you’ll need to have first completed\\nyour main adventure in the [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Paldea region[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] by\\r\\ncompleting the professor’s last task, as well as\\r\\nconclude the assignment you were given during\\r\\nyour school trip to the [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]land of Kitakami[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]!",
